<div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">1</span><div class="step-body"><span class="step-label">足歲（已經過完幾次生日）</span><span class="step-val" id="detailExact">—</span></div></div>
<div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">2</span><div class="step-body"><span class="step-label">距上次生日的零數</span><span class="step-val" id="detailZero">—</span></div></div>
